{"id":"vod_bf_19223","vodId":"19223","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"狼与香辛料","name_cn":"狼与香辛料","date":"2008-01-01","year":"2008","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-20/81bcf3fb826a58a5b6007952ecd80f22.jpg"},"summary":"在世界各地旅行并收购贩卖物品的旅行商人克拉福•劳伦斯在经过正在庆祝收获节的帕斯罗村后离开，却在自己堆满麦束的货车上发现了正在睡觉的少女。少女有狼的耳朵和尾巴，更有美丽的脸庞，她自报家门称自己是掌管丰收的狼神“赫萝”。　　虽然对这样的介绍半信半疑，但在赫萝的花言巧语之下，劳伦斯答应带赫萝回到遥远的北方故乡，就这样二人展开了旅行商人的旅程，并在行商途中遇到了各式各样的事件。　　赫萝的出现，改变了劳伦斯原本孤独的经商生活。虽然常常被赫萝狡猾的言论捉弄，但他与赫萝的羁绊也因此越来越深","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 00:14:21","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/langyuxiangxinliao/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/langyuxiangxinliao/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/langyuxiangxinliao/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/langyuxiangxinliao/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/langyuxiangxinliao/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/langyuxiangxinliao/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/langyuxiangxinliao/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/langyuxiangxinliao/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/langyuxiangxinliao/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/langyuxiangxinliao/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/langyuxiangxinliao/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/langyuxiangxinliao/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/langyuxiangxinliao/第13集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:15:29.267Z"}